    {
      "heading": "Alerts",
      "level": 0,
      "markdown": "**CLOSURE** - October 27: 33 Area Fitness Center will be closed from 3pm - 7:30pm to support the 33 Area Trunk-or-Treat event.\n\n**PHONE OUTAGE** - The 21 Area Fitness Center phone line is currently down. For assistance, call Semper Fit Headquarters at (760) 725-6288. Please leave a message and we will return your call as soon as possible.\n\n**UNMANNED CAC ACCESS** - November 7: Due to a scheduled power outage, unmanned CAC access (24/7 access) at 62 Area Fitness Center will be limited."
